# CDK asset staging directory
.cdk.staging
cdk.out
# `/docs/*` (not `/docs/`) so subdirectory negations below take effect.
# Git can't re-include files whose parent directory is excluded, so the
# parent must stay un-excluded; we exclude its CONTENTS instead.
/docs/*
# Pilot-greenlight plan + per-pilot dossiers are tracked — the rest of
# /docs/ stays local-only for working notes. Specific files force-added
# in the past (docs/AWS_CLI_OPERATIONS_GUIDE.md, docs/decisions/*) remain
# tracked under their own pre-existing add.
!/docs/pilot-greenlight/
!/docs/pilots/
# `docs/deploys/INDEX.md` is the curated deploy audit trail per CLAUDE.md;
# tracked here. Raw .log/.csv files in docs/deploys/ remain ignored — they're
# operator-runtime artifacts (build output, ECS responses, smoke data) that
# don't add durable signal beyond what INDEX.md captures.
!/docs/deploys/
/docs/deploys/*
!/docs/deploys/INDEX.md
# V1 platform-hardening sprint plan (drives Sprints A-D post-first-pilot).
!/docs/platform-hardening/
# Governance-body archetype framework plan (cross-repo north-star + backend plan).
!/docs/archetype-framework/
# Student Attendance Domain epic (PABSON daily-first; evidence-based roadmap).
!/docs/attendance-domain/
# Alpha-launch readiness plan (RBAC-first re-prioritization; ABAC hardening spine).
!/docs/alpha-launch/
# Architecture Decision Records (existing ADRs were force-added; track the dir).
!/docs/decisions/
# Finance Module bulk-operations sprint plan (grade-level filter, bulk PDF download).
!/docs/finance-bulk-ops/
# Pilot Onboarding Hardening sprint plan (PR-PD Previous Dues + PR-CA Custom Yearly Fee Agreement).
!/docs/pilot-onboarding-hardening/
# EPIC-FB Family Billing Agreements (audit + 6-sprint/51-task plan; reconciles with PR-CA).
!/docs/family-billing/
# Operator runbooks (Saraswati on-call, IEMIS post-mortem, finance-previous-dues PD.4.1, etc.).
# Files in this directory were historically force-added; tracking the whole directory
# avoids ad-hoc per-file negations and matches the pattern used by /docs/finance-bulk-ops/.
!/docs/operations/
# Performance + load-test reports (Sprint E load test, finance instrumentation
# reference for issues #344 + #345). Same shape as /docs/operations/ —
# track the whole directory so future perf docs land here without a
# .gitignore edit each time.
!/docs/perf/
*service-info.json
cdk.context.json
